'''The Pure Land (Merciless)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] unlocked after clearing [[River Acheron]]. It was added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]] and appears on the '''11th''', '''12th''', '''25th''', and '''26th''' of every month. When clearing this stage, there is a chance to unlock [[Medusa Cat (Rare Cat)|Medusa Cat]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

